  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="13" /><char style="w" strong="G1125">I am writing</char> <char style="w" strong="G4771">to you</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3962">fathers</char>, <char style="w" strong="G3754">because</char> <char style="w" strong="G1097">you know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">Him who [is]</char> <char style="w" strong="G575">from</char> <char style="w" strong="G746">[the] beginning</char>.</para>
