  <para style="s1">Beware of Antichrists</para>
  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="18" /><char style="w" strong="G3813">Children</char>, <char style="w" strong="G1510">it is</char> <char style="w" strong="G2078">[the] last</char> <char style="w" strong="G5610">hour</char>; <char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G2531">just as</char> <char style="w" strong="G191">you have heard</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">that</char> <char style="w" strong="G500">the antichrist</char> <char style="w" strong="G2064">is coming</char>, <char style="w" strong="G2532">so</char> <char style="w" strong="G3568">now</char> <char style="w" strong="G4183">many</char> <char style="w" strong="G500">antichrists</char> <char style="w" strong="G1096">have appeared</char>. <char style="w" strong="G3606">This is how</char> <char style="w" strong="G1097">we know</char> <char style="w" strong="G3754">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">it is</char> <char style="w" strong="G2078">[the] last</char> <char style="w" strong="G5610">hour</char>. <verse style="v" number="19" /><char style="w" strong="G1831">They went out</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">from</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char>, <char style="w" strong="G235">but</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">they did not belong</char> <char style="w" strong="G3756">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">. . .</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">to us</char>. <char style="w" strong="G1063">For</char> <char style="w" strong="G1487">if</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">they had belonged</char> <char style="w" strong="G1537">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char>, <char style="w" strong="G302">vvv</char> <char style="w" strong="G3306">they would have remained</char> <char style="w" strong="G3326">with</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">us</char>. <char style="w" strong="G235">But</char> <char style="w" strong="G2443">[their departure]</char> <char style="w" strong="G5319">made it clear</char> <char style="w" stro